  <item>
    <title>03.提升行动力、用行动控制大脑、应对变化：邓亚萍的强大心力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67162adddb2cf82757d39b6d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67162adddb2cf82757d39b6d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Oct 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h1><span>本期节目是和《肆意妄为》主播双菱共创的一期读书内容。</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>那些做成事的人都是怎么做到的？</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>如何快速进入工作/学习状态？</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>注意力太集中反而效率低？</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>怎么做才能有成长型思维？</span></h1><span></span><p><span>看完被播客《自习室studyroom》种草邓亚萍的《心力》后，我们特别想聊聊这本书。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>邓亚萍本科清华读英语，硕士诺丁汉大学读中国当代研究，博士剑桥读经济学，后任职共青团北京市委副书记、人民日报社副秘书长、即刻搜索总经理、中国政法大学兼职教授、体育创业、河南省妇联执行委员会常委。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>邓亚萍克服了无数的困难，抗住了难以想象的压力，才拥有了比别人几辈子都精彩的人生。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>她说体育给她带来最大的收获不是金牌，而是心力，也就是心理素质。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>她相信世界上没有天生的失败者，也没有天生的赢家。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>能力可以锻炼，心力也同样可以锻炼。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 18个世界冠军归零后成为剑桥经济学博士，敢于</span><strong><span>“归零”</span></strong><span>的邓亚萍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 什么？26个字母都写不出来还能去清华读英语专业？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> “竞争”的要义在于</span><strong><span>挑战自我、超越自我</span></strong><span>，而不是打倒别人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 赢家：做成事情需要</span><strong><span>“咬牙切齿”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> </span><strong><span>行为可以控制大脑</span></strong><span>：紧张到不行的博士答辩，邓亚萍靠扔书这个动作通过了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a> 行为改变心态：要严肃，我就皱眉；要发泄，我就学米老鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">21:53</a> “</span><strong><span>失败清单</span></strong><span>”：预设意外发生更能让你处变不惊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1453">24:13</a> </span><strong><span>"not to do list</span></strong><span>"让你的大脑更专注</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a> </span><strong><span>“主动分心</span></strong><span>”让你更高效，边学边看“study with me”视频真的能学进去！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1741">29:01</a> 成长型思维：你的大脑一辈子都可以被塑造！选不上省队但进了国家队，一条腿瘫痪但能拿短跑冠军</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1931">32:11</a> 大学专业不会限制你的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2021">33:41</a> “</span><strong><span>意象训练</span></strong><span>”——好消息！看别人运动等于我也运动了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a> 信念的力量能救我狗命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2319">38:39</a></span><strong><span> 应对变化的唯一出路是主动出击</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【关于主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《肆意妄为》陆双菱</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>🔍登登公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zB8PDkKnM6sfHh0vc1sq4Q" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zB8PDkKnM6sfHh0vc1sq4Q"><span>绿灯时刻</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvCPYMCufMUCIyh1j6M6W-ll1sd9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：登登、陆双菱</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制、剪辑：登登、陆双菱</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：登登</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提及书目】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《心力》邓亚萍</span></p><span></span><p><span>《高效能人士的七个习惯》史蒂芬·柯维</span></p><span></span><p><span>【背景音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Neon by Roa </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/roa_music1031" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/roa_music1031"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvNPfQgVK9mPoee-KTKoJyexnsqA.m4a" length="65043145" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpSK7qEBdv1E-i7k_AimC2Gqe9Us.png"/>
