  <item>
    <title>02.“跨行达人”三次跳槽涨薪幅度均为100%，40岁裸辞依旧能回归职场的秘籍</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670cbc780d2f24f289f50f83</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670cbc780d2f24f289f50f83</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Oct 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是和</span><strong><span>从月薪4000到年薪40W的“过于优秀的打工人”Karen的对话，工作一路过关斩将的她在40岁前夕选择裸辞，原因却是底层的不自信。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>通过聊天，我看到一个十几岁起就有明确目标并勇往直前的Karen。</span></p><span></span><p><span>出身于内蒙的三线城市，原生家庭不能给她正反馈，那就离开家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从国企到华强北档口，从外企到独角兽公司再到初创公司，随着工作越来越顺利，Karen却发现找不到自己的价值，于是果断裸辞，把自己重新养一遍。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有问题？无所谓，姐来解决。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“跨行达人”Karen不仅在事业上做到三次跳槽涨薪幅度均为100%，还能在39岁为了寻找自我而选择裸辞。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你想知道职场涨薪技巧、想获得裸辞后回归职场的能力、想了解Karen的心路历程，快来收听本期节目吧~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期节目福利】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我和Karen分别开放</span><strong><span>5个随喜咨询名额</span></strong><span>（1小时），只需要</span><strong><span>订阅《绿灯时刻》并在本期节目下留言，添加登登或Karen好友（备注：播客绿灯时刻）</span></strong><span>，先到先得哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> &nbsp;原生家庭让Karen的自信心受挫？与其强求改变父母，不如寻找适合自己的环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> &nbsp;多年销售竟然会下意识用言语贬低自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a> &nbsp;从月薪4000到年薪40W，Karen的职场之路：国企-华强北-外企-独角兽公司-初创公司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">16:56</a> &nbsp;工作有成后，面对自我价值感的缺失、严重的情绪问题，Karen选择裸辞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> &nbsp;40岁裸辞依旧有底气回归职场，Karen给出的职场必备能力：主动承担岗位之外的职责、主动在内部寻找机会、培养垂直能力、积累HR人脉资源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> &nbsp;给女孩的建议：如何克服自己的恐惧？要试错，不要完美主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">29:11</a> &nbsp;裸辞后重新养自己的方式：去旅行、去自我觉知、学习设计人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a> &nbsp;走出困境的必答题：我是谁？我用什么方式和这个世界相处？我想通过哪些事情实现自己的价值？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> &nbsp;什么时候才能裸辞？Karen在裸辞前的自我评估</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2358">39:18</a> &nbsp;不敢走出去？从参加最简单的活动开始吧，哪怕只是周末几小时</span></p><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>嘉宾介绍</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：tiantiantian1717</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：田田重新活一遍</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/601929fc000000000101e9c2?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=64f6e426000000000200cb72&amp;apptime=1728881823&amp;share_id=b5cecbbe3e0249beae3e1a64dd6790c6" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/601929fc000000000101e9c2?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=64f6e426000000000200cb72&amp;apptime=1728881823&amp;share_id=b5cecbbe3e0249beae3e1a64dd6790c6"><span>田田重新活一遍</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔍公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zB8PDkKnM6sfHh0vc1sq4Q" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zB8PDkKnM6sfHh0vc1sq4Q"><span>绿灯时刻</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64f6e426000000000200cb72?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=64f6e426000000000200cb72&amp;apptime=1728881902&amp;share_id=4d88b47896f44d199ae43c53be891a64" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64f6e426000000000200cb72?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=64f6e426000000000200cb72&amp;apptime=1728881902&amp;share_id=4d88b47896f44d199ae43c53be891a64"><span>登登真行</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（扫码加微信备注：播客绿灯时刻）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>本期制作</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：登登</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Karen</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：登登</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：登登</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：登登</span></p><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Palma by Scandinavianz </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/scandinavianz" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/scandinavianz"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
