    <title>01:从体制内和上市公司裸辞后做自由职业，就是从别人画饼变成自己画饼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670a6e25db2cf82757b26cff</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670a6e25db2cf82757b26cff</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 12 Oct 2024 17:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是和《破圈对话》的串台，主题是两个裸辞人关于裸辞和自由职业的快乐（xin suan）生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>经历了裸辞后的短暂喘息、长期迷茫和焦虑，目前处于自己给自己画饼的阶段，我才知道人生的确是旷野，但是现在得自己修铁路了！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你有辞职的想法，一定不要错过这期的内容！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你已经裸辞，那就来和我们一起愉快交流吧~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a>：以账号为管道，将我们相信的内容传递出去——“绿灯时刻”和“破圈对话”的起名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a> &nbsp;没有收入的自由职业做起来超开心?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> &nbsp;上班吃别人画的饼，辞职后吃自己画的饼，不然就会饿死！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> &nbsp;别怕，裸辞后失落的“等待期”是必然的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> &nbsp;裸辞人：都说“人生是旷野”，没人告诉我跳出轨道后要自己修铁路啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> &nbsp;给上班朋友们的建议：非必要不裸辞，做好准备再跳车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a> &nbsp;在不确定性的环境下，想要结果又不想承担后果怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> &nbsp;赚小钱还有机会吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> &nbsp;爱折腾的自由职业者也是会EMO的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a> &nbsp;快速试错并迭代比等待完美更重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>嘉宾介绍</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669e000ffc1bcd4e048bee5b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669e000ffc1bcd4e048bee5b"><span>《破圈对话》</span></a><span>主播-萌萌</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr-8RTgWuAOiUZx3H5jQn6fEbFtV.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>本期制作</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：登登、萌萌</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：登登、萌萌</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：登登</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：登登</span></p><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Never Alone by Roa </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/roa_music1031" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/roa_music1031"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>关于主播</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuS9VFOpSPfmm8tInPmkH2YOmXhP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔍公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zB8PDkKnM6sfHh0vc1sq4Q" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zB8PDkKnM6sfHh0vc1sq4Q"><span>绿灯时刻</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>扫码加我微信，</span><strong><span>备注：播客</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_dTtofmpcDs2E_LXDjbeRQOi2_.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
